<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment reconciled by Codex. GMR's wording remains verbatim. Three chu klung compounds own three river of water phrases; the extra river recap stays unwrapped. The full potential-object relations own can see and can drink from, excluding supplied spirit participants. Separate tu na/From ownership remains unbanked; both object-case la/at relations retain their own clauses. sogs owns exactly and the other, with two excluded. Agentive kyis has no separate English exponent. Supplied sitting, repeated references and unresolved existential framing remain unbanked; no hgm_gloss promotion.</div>
